ted modern kitchen<br> Built-in wardrobes<br> <br> Community Amenities<br> Residents of Beachgate by Address enjoy access to world-class, resort-style facilities:<br> <br> Private beach access<br> Infinity swimming pool<br> Fully equipped gym<br> Children’s play areas<br> Landscaped leisure and relaxation spaces<br> Retail and dining outlets<br> 24/7 concierge and security services<br> <br> Location Highlights<br> Situated in Dubai Harbour, Emaar Beachfront offers a prime waterfront lifestyle with excellent connectivity:<br> <br> Direct access to pristine private beaches<br> Minutes from Dubai Marina and Palm Jumeirah<br> Easy access to Sheikh Zayed Road<br> Close to luxury dining, retail, and entertainment<br> Near Dubai Harbour Marina and yacht club<br> <br> An exceptional opportunity to own or invest in a luxury beachfront residence in one of Dubai’s most prestigious coastal communities.","longitude":55.1380009,"negotiator_id":"925","negotiator_mapping":"ralph.k@providentestate.com","parking":[],"price":6450000,"price_qualifier":null,"publish":1,"search_type":"sales","slug":"3-bedroom-apartment-for-sale-in-beachgate-by-address-emaar-beachfront-dubai-harbour-dubai","status":"For Sale","thumbnail":"http://provident-bx-upload-eu.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/iblock/650/6500c2db24ef6491395d1d767644a943/10.jpg","title":"3 bedroom apartment for sale","extra":{"views":"","cheques":null,"project":null,"bitrix_id":"1484606","furnished":"Unfurnished","permit_number":"71430120666","rental_period":null,"current_status":"","furnishing_type":"Unfurnished","completion_status":"off-plan","property_condition":"","property_managed_by_us":""},"video_tour":[],"virtual_tour":[],"qr_code":[{"endDate":"2026-12-05T00:00:00","project":null,"property":{"facilities":null,"propertyId":430120666,"roomTypeAr":"ثلاث غرف","roomTypeEn":"3 B/R","roomsCount":"3","zoneNameAr":"مرسى دبي","zoneNameEn":"Marsa Dubai","floorNumber":"22","salesTypeId":2,"isRegistered":false,"propertySize":148.21,"parking